WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.283
Meet Loomy.

00:00:02.433 --> 00:00:09.417
She leads delivery for a team shipping faster than ever, because AI now writes a big share of the code.

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:13.550
But faster code doesn't mean faster delivery.

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:20.050
Work piles up in review and testing, decisions wait, and the board stops telling the truth.

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:24.583
Pinpointing where it breaks takes hours of digging.

00:00:24.567 --> 00:00:27.317
And at the end, she's still guessing.

00:00:28.533 --> 00:00:31.383
So she connects her boards to Steerloom.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.450
Read-only.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.783
It never changes a thing.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:43.183
Steerloom measures how work actually moves, from the moment items change columns, not from estimates.

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:50.383
Its daily review shows where work is stuck right now, with the evidence behind every signal.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:59.783
When she asks Steerloom AI, it investigates her board and her code, within limits she controls, and shows its reasoning.

00:01:01.233 --> 00:01:04.550
She fixes the bottleneck, not the symptom.

00:01:04.533 --> 00:01:07.983
And next week, the trend shows it worked.

00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:13.817
With agentic AI, writing code isn't the bottleneck anymore.

00:01:13.833 --> 00:01:15.750
Seeing clearly is.

00:01:15.833 --> 00:01:17.017
Steerloom.

00:01:17.033 --> 00:01:19.683
Know where delivery really stands.
